<title>USA: Allergan gets FDA ok to launch trials.</title>
<headline>Allergan gets FDA ok to launch trials.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allergan Ligand Retinoid Therapeutics Inc Thursday said it received clearance from the Food and Drug Administration to launch Phase I/IIa clinical trials for the treatment of advanced cancers with ALRT1550 capsules, a new investigational anti-cancer agent.</p>
<p>The company said additional clinical targets for ALRT1550 which are currently under consideration include the following cancers: ovarian, cervical, head and neck, and breast.</p>
</text>
